{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "//": "The stop tasks are one line each because the kill list lives in scripts/dev_stop.sh. It was inline here until Zed joined VS Code as an editor of this repo: Zed merges this file into its own task list but implements neither dependsOn nor dependsOrder, so a stop task written as a fan-out over five others silently stopped nothing there. One script, two editors, no second list to forget.",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "label": "Serve site on :8090",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "python3 dev_server.py --port 8090",
      "options": { "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}/site" },
      "isBackground": true,
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": {
        "owner": "site",
        "pattern": { "regexp": "^$" },
        "background": {
          "activeOnStart": true,
          "beginsPattern": ".",
          "endsPattern": "Serving Cloudflare-style site routes on"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "App: stop dev server (3003)",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "./scripts/dev_stop.sh app",
      "options": { "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}" },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": []
    },
    {
      "label": "Phoenix: stop (6006)",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "./scripts/dev_stop.sh phoenix",
      "options": { "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}" },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": []
    },
    {
      "//": "Manual: the dev bundle is launched detached, so no debug session owns it. Quit first, kill second — the reasoning is in the script.",
      "label": "Desktop: stop Duct Dev app",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "./scripts/dev_stop.sh desktop",
      "options": { "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}" },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": []
    },
    {
      "label": "Backend: stop uvicorn (8002)",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "./scripts/dev_stop.sh backend",
      "options": { "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}" },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": []
    },
    {
      "label": "Duct: stop Site + API (8002, 8090)",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "./scripts/dev_stop.sh backend site",
      "options": { "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}" },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": []
    },
    {
      "//": "One command for the end of a session. The desktop app is launched detached via `open`, so no debug session owns it and Stop cannot close it — without this, every desktop launch leaves an app and its sidecar running until someone notices. Touches only Duct's own ports; other projects on this machine are not its business.",
      "label": "Duct: stop everything",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "./scripts/dev_stop.sh all",
      "options": { "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}" },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": []
    },
    {
      "label": "Site: stop dev server (8090)",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "./scripts/dev_stop.sh site",
      "options": { "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}" },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": []
    }
  ]
}
